seg-67e04a43cea8 = The wasm build embeds the English catalogue only. The other sixteen would add about { "150" } kB gzip each. A page fetches <c1/> on a language choice and calls <c2/>; if the fetch or the registration fails the page stays in English. Native, the command line and the Python wheel embed all { "18" }.

