seg-fdea76581cd8 = <c1/> holds the messages, ids prefixed <c2/>. <c3/> is the source; the other files are the translators' and may lack messages (each falls back to English per message). Companion lists in <c4/>: <c5/> (messages with count variables, for plural forms), <c6/> (numbers passed as placeables), <c7/> (messages that are pieces of a sentence assembled at run time: to be merged into whole-sentence messages, never to grow).

